      "id": "king-henry-the-fifth/sceneIV_11.2/p@123417",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "DAUPHIN.\nShall we go send them dinners and fresh suits\nAnd give their fasting horses provender,\nAnd after fight with them?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
